      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4999 - Al-Alaa narrated from Muhammad ibn Muslim, who reported from one of the two Imams (peace be upon them), who said:\n\"If a man has intercourse with the slave woman of his wife, then upon him is the same punishment as that of a fornicator.\""
        ]
